### Variables
@apiKey = your-api-key-here
@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Search CosmosDB - Basic Search
POST {{baseUrl}}/search_cosmosdb
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": [
    "What is the project timeline?",
    "When is the project deadline?",
    "What are the key milestones?"
  ]
}

### Search CosmosDB - Search with Entities
POST {{baseUrl}}/search_cosmosdb
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": [
    "SharePoint integration requirements",
    "How to integrate with SharePoint?",
    "SharePoint API documentation",
    "SharePoint authentication setup"
  ],
  "entities": ["SharePoint", "integration", "requirements"]
}

### Search CosmosDB - Multiple Entities
POST {{baseUrl}}/search_cosmosdb
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": [
    "Azure Functions deployment best practices",
    "How to deploy Azure Functions?",
    "Azure Functions configuration guide",
    "Optimize Azure Functions performance",
    "Azure Functions security recommendations"
  ],
  "entities": ["Azure Functions", "deployment", "best practices", "configuration"]
}

### Search CosmosDB - From testdata.json (Cosmos DB Vector Search Configuration)
POST {{baseUrl}}/search_cosmosdb
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./testdata.json

### Search CosmosDB - Cosmos DB Vector Search Configuration (Full Query)
POST {{baseUrl}}/search_cosmosdb
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": ["How do I configure Cosmos DB for vector search?"],
  "entities": ["Cosmos DB", "vector search", "configuration", "embeddings"]
}

### Search CosmosDB - Cosmos DB Configuration (Shorter Query)
POST {{baseUrl}}/search_cosmosdb
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": ["How do I configure Cosmos DB?"],
  "entities": ["Cosmos DB", "vector search", "configuration", "embeddings"]
}

### Search CosmosDB - Configure Cosmos DB Vector Search (Alternative Phrasing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/search_cosmosdb
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": ["configure Cosmos DB for vector search"],
  "entities": ["Cosmos DB", "vector search", "configuration", "embeddings"]
}

### Search CosmosDB - Invalid Request (Missing search parameter)
POST {{baseUrl}}/search_cosmosdb
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entities": ["test"]
}

### Search CosmosDB - Invalid Request (Empty search)
POST {{baseUrl}}/search_cosmosdb
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": [],
  "entities": ["test"]
}

### Search CosmosDB - No Authentication
POST {{baseUrl}}/search_cosmosdb
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": [
    "test query",
    "another test query"
  ]
}
